The 1888–89 season was the second season of football by [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]. They competed in the Scottish Cup, Glasgow Exhibition Cup, [[Glasgow Charity Cup|Glasgow Merchants Charity Cup]], [[Glasgow Cup]] and [[Glasgow North Eastern Cup]], they won the latter for the second consecutive year.

